---
import LessonShell from '../components/LessonShell.astro';
import LessonSkeleton from '../components/LessonSkeleton.astro';
import AdjectiveDeclensionTrainer from '../components/AdjectiveDeclensionTrainer.jsx';

export const frontmatter = {
  title: "Lektion 6｜形容詞字尾",
  description: "練習冠詞、形容詞與名詞片語：der gute Film、einen interessanten Film、mit schönen Bildern。",
  category: "文法練習",
  tags: ["A2-B1", "Adjektive", "Deklination", "Dativ"],
  order: 6,
  level: "A2-B1",
  estimatedMinutes: 25,
  theme: "amber"
};
---

<LessonShell frontmatter={frontmatter}>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <AdjectiveDeclensionTrainer client:only="react"><LessonSkeleton slot="fallback" /></AdjectiveDeclensionTrainer>
  </div>

  <li slot="tips" class="flex items-start gap-2">
    <span class="text-current opacity-70 mt-0.5">•</span>
    <span>先判斷冠詞類型，再判斷名詞性別與格位，最後才選形容詞字尾。</span>
  </li>
  <li slot="tips" class="flex items-start gap-2">
    <span class="text-current opacity-70 mt-0.5">•</span>
    <span>看到 mit、aus、nach 這類介系詞，先把後面的名詞片語放進 Dativ。</span>
  </li>
  <li slot="tips" class="flex items-start gap-2">
    <span class="text-current opacity-70 mt-0.5">•</span>
    <span>無冠詞題是 B1 挑戰，重點是形容詞要承擔更多文法資訊。</span>
  </li>
</LessonShell>
